laya.cpp
  https://github.com/lkarlslund/laya.cpp
  Copyright (c) 2026 Lars Karlslund. MIT License.
  The native C++ port of Laya inference, and the engine of the LibLayaX library that
  Laya.pas loads.

  LayaTokenizer.pas and LayaContext.pas are Pascal versions of two parts of laya.cpp: its
  tokenizer (src/tokenizer.cpp) and its request preparation (src/protocol.cpp). They were
  written to give the same result as that code, token for token. The fixtures in testdata/
  are those of laya.cpp (tests/tokenizer-cases.json and tests/tokenizer-multilingual.json)
  in another file format. The license of laya.cpp applies to these parts:

